{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Fear Chants: Echoes of the Devil",
    "steam_appid": 3534700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534700/extras/2b8b467534ccde50ce936234e6a060a2.avif?t=1741686736\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your whispers feed the terror. The darkness answers your fears.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a house lost to time, every step you take echoes like a sacrificial chant, summoning something that should never be awakened.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fear Chants: Echoes of the Devil</strong> is a psychological horror experience that will test your sanity\u2014where the line between reality and nightmare fades away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is watching you. Something is listening. Ancient chants reverberate through the decaying hallways, carrying with them an evil presence that knows your deepest fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oppressive Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Explore a forsaken house where silence is a lie, and every shadow hides a secret.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Horror</strong> \u2013 The game reacts to your choices, your anxiety, and your movements. The more afraid you are, the weaker you become.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dark Mystery to Unravel</strong> \u2013 Uncover the truth behind forbidden rituals and demonic entities haunting the house.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Survival</strong> \u2013 With no weapons and no certainty, you must rely on your wits and courage to escape the lurking darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the door. Step into the unknown. But whatever you do\u2014<strong>do not repeat the chants\u2026 or he will hear you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to face the echoes of the devil?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534700/extras/2b8b467534ccde50ce936234e6a060a2.avif?t=1741686736\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your whispers feed the terror. The darkness answers your fears.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a house lost to time, every step you take echoes like a sacrificial chant, summoning something that should never be awakened.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fear Chants: Echoes of the Devil</strong> is a psychological horror experience that will test your sanity\u2014where the line between reality and nightmare fades away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is watching you. Something is listening. Ancient chants reverberate through the decaying hallways, carrying with them an evil presence that knows your deepest fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oppressive Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Explore a forsaken house where silence is a lie, and every shadow hides a secret.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Horror</strong> \u2013 The game reacts to your choices, your anxiety, and your movements. The more afraid you are, the weaker you become.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dark Mystery to Unravel</strong> \u2013 Uncover the truth behind forbidden rituals and demonic entities haunting the house.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Survival</strong> \u2013 With no weapons and no certainty, you must rely on your wits and courage to escape the lurking darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the door. Step into the unknown. But whatever you do\u2014<strong>do not repeat the chants\u2026 or he will hear you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to face the echoes of the devil?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Trapped in a cursed house, ancient chants echo in the darkness, awakening an unspeakable evil. The Fear Chants: Echoes of the Devil is a psychological horror where your fears come to life. Explore, survive, and uncover the truth\u2026 but whatever you do, do not repeat the chants.",
